WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
- We are back and it's
game time with Salma Hayek.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.740
Give it up for her!
(clapping and cheering)

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.480
We just celebrated some creepy holidays

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:09.680
like Halloween, of course.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.270
And since there's some
residual creepiness in the air,

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.755
it is time to play "What's
Creepin' Up On Me?"

00:00:14.755 --> 00:00:16.534
(upbeat music)
(clapping and cheering)

00:00:16.534 --> 00:00:20.331
♪ What's creepin' up on me ♪

00:00:20.331 --> 00:00:22.123
- (laughing) I love you so much.

00:00:22.123 --> 00:00:24.510
♪ What's creepin' up on me? ♪

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.480
So weird, oh, I love you.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.450
And you're so cute that you
make it cool, it's so annoying.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.710
You and Salma can just go
on an island away from me.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.650
- Oh, wow.
(laughing)

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.450
- So how competitive, are you competitive?

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.750
You told me in the break
that you're, are you?

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.307
(crowd laughing)

00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:41.298
- (laughs) Are you?
- I'm not.

00:00:41.298 --> 00:00:44.443
I'm not that competitive,
but I love people

00:00:44.443 --> 00:00:45.446
who are competitive.
- Okay.

00:00:45.446 --> 00:00:47.740
You're gonna love me.
- I find it hilarious.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:48.850
So I like to push their buttons.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:50.360
- Okay, oh, I love it!

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.349
Push them, okay, so
we're on the same team--

00:00:52.349 --> 00:00:53.828
- I'm gonna win.

00:00:53.828 --> 00:00:55.513
- (laughs) Well, we're on the same team.

00:00:55.513 --> 00:00:56.346
- Oh, okay.

00:00:56.346 --> 00:00:58.450
- So we both lose.
- Then I am gonna win.

00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.540
- Yes, yes.
(laughing)

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.200
Well, this is the good
news, this is how it works.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.040
Salma will start with
her back to the screen.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.910
I'll give her clues about
what's creepin' up behind her,

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:09.230
on the screen, without
saying the name of the thing.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:10.600
So I have to describe it.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.390
Then we're gonna switch and
Salma will give me clues.

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:14.730
We can pass if one is too hard.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:17.050
Just say, "pass" if I'm sucking at it.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:20.140
If we can correctly guess
11 things in two rounds,

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.470
the audience will win a cool prize.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:24.302
Let's not let them down.
(cheering and clapping)

00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:25.390
Okay, so ready?

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's get in position.
- No pressure.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.100
- Okay, so I'm giving you clues first.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:31.703
Okay, so let's start the clock and go!

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.020
Oh, hoo, hoo!

00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:35.853
- Owl!

00:01:35.853 --> 00:01:37.140
- Yes!
(dings)

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.631
Oh. (hisses)

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:39.464
- Snake!

00:01:39.464 --> 00:01:40.780
- Yes!
(dings)

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.900
Okay. (cackles)

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:43.733
- Witch!

00:01:43.733 --> 00:01:45.484
- Yes!
(dings)

00:01:45.484 --> 00:01:47.557
Oh, he's so good, "Deadpool"!

00:01:47.557 --> 00:01:49.090
"Deadpool"?

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.060
- Oh, Ryan.
- Oh, "The Proposal," yes!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.671
Yes, Ryan Reynolds.
(dings)

00:01:52.671 --> 00:01:54.690
(clapping)
Ooh, oh.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.201
Oh, this is Tex-Mex.

00:01:56.201 --> 00:01:58.423
(stammers) Oh, how do you describe it?

00:01:58.423 --> 00:01:59.460
- Chicken con carne!

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:02.210
- It's runny and you dip chips in it.

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:04.930
- Oh, (stammers) is it nachos?
- You dip chips in it.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.323
Kind of, what's on nachos?

00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:08.442
How do you say--
(stammering)

00:02:08.442 --> 00:02:09.275
- Guacamole?

00:02:09.275 --> 00:02:11.990
- Oh God, pass, pass, pass!
(laughing)

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:13.720
Oh. (buzzes)

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:14.553
- Fly.

00:02:14.553 --> 00:02:16.762
- Yes!
(dings)

00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:20.192
(talking over each other)
What, oh! (mumbles)

00:02:20.192 --> 00:02:21.025
- Dentist.

00:02:21.025 --> 00:02:22.105
- Yeah!
(dings)

00:02:22.105 --> 00:02:23.538
(cheering and clapping)
Okay, and then, oh.

00:02:23.538 --> 00:02:24.775
(exhales) And then--

00:02:24.775 --> 00:02:25.608
- Birthday!

00:02:25.608 --> 00:02:27.197
- Yup.
- Birthday, mordida.

00:02:27.197 --> 00:02:28.479
(dings)
Angelina!

00:02:28.479 --> 00:02:33.479
- Okay, okay.
(horn blares)

00:02:33.599 --> 00:02:35.754
What did I do for dentist? (laughs)

00:02:35.754 --> 00:02:36.770
- I don't know, but I got it.
- You got it!

00:02:36.770 --> 00:02:38.310
We're switching.
- I'm bad but I'm psychic.

00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:41.492
- Okay, we're switching.
(cheering)

00:02:41.492 --> 00:02:43.592
- I'm not gonna be able to talk that fast.

00:02:44.478 --> 00:02:46.522
You're gonna be angry at me
'cause you're competitive.

00:02:46.522 --> 00:02:47.548
- No, I'm not gonna be angry with you.

00:02:47.548 --> 00:02:48.470
You're Salma Hayek, I love you.

00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:51.280
Okay, so go, let's do it.
(laughing)

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.573
- Oh, Day of the Dead.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:54.272
- What, Dia de los--
(stammers)

00:02:54.272 --> 00:02:55.920
- They're very hard, it's--

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:56.753
- Skeleton?

00:02:56.753 --> 00:02:57.674
- Yes.

00:02:57.674 --> 00:03:00.270
(cheering and clapping)
(dings)

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.621
Oh, the itsy bitsy--
- Zombie.

00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:03.704
Spider!
- Yes.

00:03:03.704 --> 00:03:05.710
(dings)
(clapping)

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:07.830
Okay, meow.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.280
- Cat?
(laughing)

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.270
