00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.300
When you have diarrhea, you go to there.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.648
(beeps)
(laughing)

00:03:14.648 --> 00:03:15.736
- Yes!
(dings)

00:03:15.736 --> 00:03:17.710
(laughing)
(clapping)

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.000
Okay, oink oink!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.065
- Pig?

00:03:21.065 --> 00:03:22.850
- No, that was the wrong one, I'm sorry.

00:03:22.850 --> 00:03:27.114
Spring, spring, this animal
in spring is very popular.

00:03:27.114 --> 00:03:27.947
- A lamb!
(laughing)

00:03:27.947 --> 00:03:29.810
- No, it goes. (brays)

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:30.643
- Donkey!

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:32.195
- Yes.
(dings)

00:03:32.195 --> 00:03:33.306
Oink oink?

00:03:33.306 --> 00:03:35.156
- Okay.
(laughing)

00:03:35.156 --> 00:03:36.520
(horn blares)

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.827
Oh, this is like--
- Oh, did we get it?

00:03:37.827 --> 00:03:42.827
We did it, we did it!
(cheering)

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:46.556
(screaming)
(clapping)

00:03:46.556 --> 00:03:48.100
- We're good!
- We are amazing.

